how much you bought it for.

00:03:13.720 --> 00:03:17.550
You are making good on the deal
by giving him back his card.

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:19.380
You, on the other hand, are stoked

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:21.910
because you borrowed that card for free,

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:24.050
